# External reference data. The tree stays ignored wholesale so a fresh drop
# cannot be committed by accident; the three variants our benchmarks actually
# use are re-included explicitly. See data/README.md.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/Variant 1 Step Dam-Break/
!data/Variant 3 Circular Dam-Break/
!data/Variant 4 Gaussian Dam-Break/

# third-party reference code (cloned, not ours)
third_party/
